              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "OpenEXR: Heap Overflow in Scanline Deep Data Parsing"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Due to a failure in validating the number of scanline samples of a OpenEXR file containing deep scanline data, Academy Software Foundation OpenEX image parsing library version 3.2.1 and prior is susceptible to a heap-based buffer overflow vulnerability. This issue was resolved as of versions v3.2.2 and v3.1.12 of the affected library."
              },
